4010
02:26:23.720 --> 02:26:25.610
I wanted to prove something to myself

4011
02:26:25.610 --> 02:26:27.320
about my own capabilities.

4012
02:26:27.320 --> 02:26:31.047
I felt like I had things I needed to say for myself

4013
02:26:31.047 --> 02:26:34.160
and to prove to myself about my athletic potential.

4014
02:26:34.160 --> 02:26:37.210
And then that evolved into leveraging

4015
02:26:37.210 --> 02:26:39.250
it as similar to Robbie,

4016
02:26:39.250 --> 02:26:42.320
like a platform to talk about plant-based nutrition

4017
02:26:42.320 --> 02:26:45.030
and also a kind of human potential

4018
02:26:45.030 --> 02:26:48.540
as we start to age because I was doing it in my 40s.

4019
02:26:48.540 --> 02:26:50.970
And that became a narrative that created

4020
02:26:50.970 --> 02:26:53.210
