4021
02:26:53.210 --> 02:26:55.950
But you know, I turn 55 next week.

4022
02:26:55.950 --> 02:26:59.720
So I'm in a very different stage of life than Robbie.

4023
02:26:59.720 --> 02:27:04.370
And it's a less,

4024
02:27:04.370 --> 02:27:08.410
it's really not about competition for me anymore.

4025
02:27:08.410 --> 02:27:09.880
My life is very different.

4026
02:27:09.880 --> 02:27:13.100
I have a lot of responsibilities and I'm privileged

4027
02:27:13.100 --> 02:27:15.310
to be in a situation where I have this platform

4028
02:27:15.310 --> 02:27:18.610
where I have the opportunity to communicate with people

4029
02:27:18.610 --> 02:27:21.120
like Robbie and share those conversations.

4030
02:27:21.120 --> 02:27:25.440
And that is really kind of like my focus

4031
02:27:25.440 --> 02:27:29.950
and in addition to being my vocation, like my passion.

4032
02:27:29.950 --> 02:27:34.950
So the idea that I'm gonna go and train 25, 30, 35 hours

4033
02:27:35.440 --> 02:27:39.170
a week to go do some challenge as appealing as that is

4034
02:27:39.170 --> 02:27:42.800
for me to like leave my life and live in a cabin and train,

4035
02:27:42.800 --> 02:27:45.010
like that's just not my life anymore,

4036
02:27:45.010 --> 02:27:47.120
nor do I want it to be my life anymore.

4037
02:27:47.120 --> 02:27:49.140
Like I wake up every day and think,

4038
02:27:49.140 --> 02:27:52.610
what is the thing that I can do today that will move

4039
02:27:52.610 --> 02:27:54.330
the needle in the most significant way

4040
02:27:54.330 --> 02:27:56.150
for the most number of people.

4041
02:27:56.150 --> 02:27:58.980
And often that's having podcast conversations

4042
02:27:58.980 --> 02:28:02.150
or writing or putting out a book or, you know,

4043
02:28:02.150 --> 02:28:04.780
getting on a plane to go give a speech somewhere.

4044
02:28:04.780 --> 02:28:08.050
And I think athletic pursuits have their place in that.

4045
02:28:08.050 --> 02:28:11.200
But I see myself now more as an ambassador

4046
02:28:11.200 --> 02:28:13.250
and somebody who can be a catalyst

4047
02:28:13.250 --> 02:28:16.680
for another individual's version

4048
02:28:16.680 --> 02:28:18.020
of what I've already experienced.

4049
02:28:18.020 --> 02:28:19.610
Like I don't feel like, yeah,

4050
02:28:19.610 --> 02:28:22.840
I could go train a lot and try to do something crazy,

4051
02:28:22.840 --> 02:28:25.203
but I've already pretty much proved to myself everything

4052
02:28:25.203 --> 02:28:28.990
that I needed to know about what I can and maybe can't do

4053
02:28:28.990 --> 02:28:30.110
as an athlete.

4054
02:28:30.110 --> 02:28:33.652
And so my focus is really more outward facing

4055
02:28:33.652 --> 02:28:37.180
and service oriented in terms of like trying to activate

4056
02:28:37.180 --> 02:28:40.130
other individuals because maybe not everyone's gonna run

4057
02:28:40.130 --> 02:28:43.100
across the country or do any other things that I've done.

4058
02:28:43.100 --> 02:28:45.010
But I think everybody inside of themselves

4059
02:28:45.010 --> 02:28:46.680
has some version of that.

4060
02:28:46.680 --> 02:28:49.730
And maybe that's becoming a stand-up comedian or a concert

4061
02:28:49.730 --> 02:28:52.480
pianist, or, you know, it doesn't even have to be athletic,

4062
02:28:52.480 --> 02:28:57.480
but the idea of trying to get people in a head space

4063
02:28:57.790 --> 02:29:02.140
to more deeply connect with expressing their inner potential

4064
02:29:02.140 --> 02:29:03.900
is kind of what I'm all about.

4065
02:29:03.900 --> 02:29:07.860
And that expression can come through the form of nutrition

4066
02:29:07.860 --> 02:29:12.062
movements, you know, business, any number of, you know,

4067
02:29:12.062 --> 02:29:14.579
creativity, any number of factors,

4068
02:29:14.579 --> 02:29:18.360
but movement is really the primary kind of force

4069
02:29:18.360 --> 02:29:19.660
behind all of it.

4070
02:29:19.660 --> 02:29:22.340
And that kind of ties it back to this idea of FAR,

4071
02:29:22.340 --> 02:29:23.380
Free Association Run,

4072
02:29:23.380 --> 02:29:26.670
which is really like using our bodies to try to connect

4073
02:29:26.670 --> 02:29:29.950
with our innate creativity so that we can be the most

4074
02:29:29.950 --> 02:29:34.950
expressed and the most expressed in our human potential.

4075
02:29:37.360 --> 02:29:39.020
Hey guys, thanks both for being here

4076
02:29:39.020 --> 02:29:41.360
has been great to hear you just curious,

