02:29:41.360 --> 02:29:42.977
I've heard a lot about the first step in running

4078
02:29:42.977 --> 02:29:45.900
and I think I have that piece down,

4079
02:29:45.900 --> 02:29:48.680
but the other thing you've talked a lot about is this idea

4080
02:29:48.680 --> 02:29:49.770
of a plant-based diet.

4081
02:29:49.770 --> 02:29:51.010
And I'm just curious,

4082
02:29:51.010 --> 02:29:53.510
like my mind's going a million miles a minute here,

4083
02:29:53.510 --> 02:29:56.180
but what you would consider kind of the first step

4084
02:29:56.180 --> 02:29:58.360
in that journey and what that really looked like for you

4085
02:29:58.360 --> 02:30:02.080
and Rich if you have anything on that too, I'm just curious.

