4094
02:30:23.970 --> 02:30:26.130
just full of greens and healthy stuff.

4095
02:30:26.130 --> 02:30:29.870
And also for me, it's an idea of getting there over time

4096
02:30:29.870 --> 02:30:33.540
is probably the best approach because if I sit up here

4097
02:30:33.540 --> 02:30:35.480
and preach absolutism and that everybody should switch

4098
02:30:35.480 --> 02:30:37.280
