02:30:39.020 --> 02:30:40.340
And then you're never gonna look at it again

4101
02:30:40.340 --> 02:30:41.780
'cause nobody wants to fail.

4102
02:30:41.780 --> 02:30:44.700
So the acknowledgement first and foremost

4103
02:30:44.700 --> 02:30:47.010
is that it will be better for you.

4104
02:30:47.010 --> 02:30:49.110
And it will definitely be better for this planet.

4105
02:30:49.110 --> 02:30:51.823
And then start making gradual steps in that direction.

4106
02:30:53.430 --> 02:30:55.330
I don't know how much more I can add to that.

4107
02:30:55.330 --> 02:30:56.330
When you asked the question,

4108
02:30:56.330 --> 02:30:57.680
I've made a little mental list of the things

4109
02:30:57.680 --> 02:31:00.530
I wanted to cover, and then he just set them all.

4110
02:31:00.530 --> 02:31:05.270
I think the other piece to that is holding it onto it

4111
02:31:05.270 --> 02:31:07.080
lightly, like make it a fun adventure.

4112
02:31:07.080 --> 02:31:09.491
It doesn't have to be like this martyrdom burdensome

4113
02:31:09.491 --> 02:31:12.118
thing where you're like, oh, it's gonna be really hard.

4114
02:31:12.118 --> 02:31:13.770
And I'm gonna have to think about this.

4115
02:31:13.770 --> 02:31:15.460
Like just have fun with it.

4116
02:31:15.460 --> 02:31:18.690
And some days you'll stray or whatever, and that's okay.

4117
02:31:18.690 --> 02:31:21.870
It's really trying to create a foundation of habits

4118
02:31:21.870 --> 02:31:25.870
that you can sustain long-term and treat it like,

4119
02:31:25.870 --> 02:31:30.570
you know, a journey as opposed to a rigid binary thing.

4120
02:31:30.570 --> 02:31:32.990
Like I'm plant-based and then the minute, like Robbie said,

4121
02:31:32.990 --> 02:31:35.170
like you go off the rails and you think, well,

4122
02:31:35.170 --> 02:31:38.090
this is too hard and you just abandon it altogether.

4123
02:31:38.090 --> 02:31:40.340
And I really do think it is about crowding out

4124
02:31:40.340 --> 02:31:44.360
the unhealthy foods and just focusing on being excited

4125
02:31:44.360 --> 02:31:46.930
about trying new things and building

4126
02:31:46.930 --> 02:31:49.010
more and more healthy foods onto your plate,

4127
02:31:49.010 --> 02:31:51.530
and then paying attention to how you feel.

4128
02:31:51.530 --> 02:31:54.590
I think making that emotional connection to it, like, well,

4129
02:31:54.590 --> 02:31:57.210
I actually do feel better today and like, noting that like,

4130
02:31:57.210 --> 02:31:58.120
well, what did I eat?

4131
02:31:58.120 --> 02:32:01.730
And paying attention to that I think really roots you

4132
02:32:01.730 --> 02:32:05.090
in sticking with it longterm,

4133
02:32:05.090 --> 02:32:08.600
and then also figuring out your why for it

4134
02:32:08.600 --> 02:32:11.660
and your why can be like, I feel fat or I feel lousy

4135
02:32:11.660 --> 02:32:12.710
and I just don't wanna feel this.

4136
02:32:12.710 --> 02:32:14.740
It doesn't have to be like, I'm gonna save the world

4137
02:32:14.740 --> 02:32:16.760
or I'm saving the animals or anything.

4138
02:32:16.760 --> 02:32:18.330
If that's your thing, that's great.

4139
02:32:18.330 --> 02:32:19.610
It can be a very simple thing,

4140
02:32:19.610 --> 02:32:23.230
but I think understanding why it is that you would wanna try

4141
02:32:23.230 --> 02:32:26.480
to engage in healthier eating habits,

4142
02:32:26.480 --> 02:32:28.650
I think is important in kind of figuring out

4143
02:32:28.650 --> 02:32:31.113
how to stay the path.

4144
