4150
02:32:44.930 --> 02:32:47.900
And I feel like in both of your more like focused,

4151
02:32:47.900 --> 02:32:50.020
goal based lifestyle,

4152
02:32:50.020 --> 02:32:51.750
you likely have found ways to kind of cut

4153
02:32:51.750 --> 02:32:53.250
to what's important in your leisure time

4154
02:32:53.250 --> 02:32:54.950
outside of your goals.

