4177
02:33:54.320 --> 02:33:56.070
like what it did for your mental health

4178
02:33:56.070 --> 02:33:58.640
and that part of being a man.

4179
02:33:58.640 --> 02:34:00.050
Yeah, I think through like running

4180
02:34:00.050 --> 02:34:02.850
and also through my journey into being plant-based

4181
02:34:02.850 --> 02:34:04.950
like compassion became a big part of that,

4182
02:34:05.860 --> 02:34:09.590
looking at like, what are these kind of toxic things

4183
02:34:09.590 --> 02:34:12.470
