4184
02:34:12.470 --> 02:34:14.210
and kind of like really looking at that and being like,

4185
02:34:14.210 --> 02:34:15.945
does that really make sense?

4186
02:34:15.945 --> 02:34:16.778
And one of those being compassion,

4187
02:34:16.778 --> 02:34:19.090
like trying to be a compassionate person,

4188
02:34:19.090 --> 02:34:22.130
this summer, as I was submitting, all of the fourteeners

4189
02:34:22.130 --> 02:34:26.550
like required being very calculated and very intentional

4190
02:34:26.550 --> 02:34:28.920
and those things are I learned from that to try

4191
02:34:28.920 --> 02:34:32.050
to be more of that in life, like to, and again,

4192
02:34:32.050 --> 02:34:35.054
try to be more intentional, not spout off, not, you know,

4193
02:34:35.054 --> 02:34:39.623
just be, have more calmness to my being.

4194
02:34:40.570 --> 02:34:42.770
Those are kind of big ones for me right now.

4195
02:34:43.980 --> 02:34:46.650
But it's always an evolution and I'm not perfect.

4196
02:34:46.650 --> 02:34:49.240
And then one also being,

