4219
02:35:36.600 --> 02:35:38.900
like if you're having like a tougher time during day

4220
02:35:38.900 --> 02:35:41.243
how do you like have something to lean on?

4221
02:35:43.300 --> 02:35:47.840
For me, like that was a really big surprise

4222
02:35:47.840 --> 02:35:50.120
