4225
02:35:53.540 --> 02:35:56.130
Like life was just gonna be easy, rainbows, birds,

4226
02:35:56.130 --> 02:35:57.480
chirping and all that good stuff.

4227
02:35:57.480 --> 02:35:59.543
And reality was it wasn't that, you know,

4228
02:36:00.963 --> 02:36:03.610
there was an immense amount of depression that came after.

4229
02:36:03.610 --> 02:36:07.670
And I think what I learned from that is just the knowledge

4230
02:36:07.670 --> 02:36:08.503
