4249
02:36:51.420 --> 02:36:53.540
even if it just means training for the year

4250
02:36:53.540 --> 02:36:55.290
until that next thing comes around.

4251
02:36:56.680 --> 02:37:01.680
For me, that's about sort of disassociating

4252
02:37:01.840 --> 02:37:06.300
