so I try to just focus on what is the next thing

4261
02:37:34.770 --> 02:37:36.330
in front of me to do?

4262
02:37:36.330 --> 02:37:39.750
So I'm not racing like Robbie or doing crazy ultra

4263
02:37:39.750 --> 02:37:42.780
