02:52:02.010 --> 02:52:07.010
that involved, not just substances, but all manner

4586
02:52:07.580 --> 02:52:11.620
of character defects that I battle with and, you know,

4587
02:52:11.620 --> 02:52:14.480
behaviors that I used to indulge without, you know,

4588
02:52:14.480 --> 02:52:18.540
thinking twice about that become more and more intolerable,

4589
02:52:18.540 --> 02:52:22.520
the closer that you kind of get to becoming, you know,

4590
02:52:22.520 --> 02:52:25.693
that version of yourself that you aspire to be,

4591
02:52:26.620 --> 02:52:28.120
but I can tell you, well, you know,

4592
02:52:28.120 --> 02:52:29.250
when I began the journey,

4593
02:52:29.250 --> 02:52:31.570
I thought my life is gonna be boring.

4594
02:52:31.570 --> 02:52:35.640
And I was gonna live this life of deprivation

4595
02:52:35.640 --> 02:52:39.670
and martyrdom, like I was sort of prison sentence

4596
02:52:39.670 --> 02:52:42.960
and my experience has been, you know, quite the contrary.

4597
02:52:42.960 --> 02:52:44.410
I mean, the idea that I'm sitting up here

4598
02:52:44.410 --> 02:52:47.460
doing this right now is like completely surreal to me

4599
02:52:47.460 --> 02:52:51.630
because I never lose touch with how I felt

4600
02:52:51.630 --> 02:52:54.520
and the person that I was back in 1998

4601
02:52:54.520 --> 02:52:58.000
when I was broken and alone, and really felt like

4602
02:52:58.000 --> 02:52:59.260
I had no future.

4603
02:52:59.260 --> 02:53:04.260
And that hopelessness is something that I need to revisit

4604
02:53:04.910 --> 02:53:07.780
in order to kind of connect with the gratitude

4605
02:53:07.780 --> 02:53:09.870
for what I get to do today.

4606
02:53:09.870 --> 02:53:13.550
But my point being that when you blaze this path

4607
02:53:13.550 --> 02:53:16.350
and you commit yourself to this ethos,

4608
02:53:16.350 --> 02:53:18.210
which is very much a part of Ten Thousand

4609
02:53:18.210 --> 02:53:22.280
better than yesterday, that your life will expand

4610
02:53:22.280 --> 02:53:26.420
in lockstep with the level of commitment that you apply

4611
02:53:26.420 --> 02:53:31.310
to that, and it puts you in a position for amazing things

4612
02:53:31.310 --> 02:53:33.930
to happen, you know, for that magic to happen,

4613
02:53:33.930 --> 02:53:37.090
for you to be in the right place at the right time,

4614
02:53:37.090 --> 02:53:39.630
for that thing that you always wanted to occur

4615
02:53:39.630 --> 02:53:41.250
to actually occur.

4616
02:53:41.250 --> 02:53:43.200
I think we're out of time.

4617
02:53:43.200 --> 02:53:45.660
I just wanna thank everybody for coming out today.

4618
02:53:45.660 --> 02:53:47.627
It's Saturday morning, you guys would be doing anything.

4619
02:53:47.627 --> 02:53:49.990
And the fact that you showed up, you went running,

4620
02:53:49.990 --> 02:53:52.350
you joined us for this conversation.

4621
02:53:52.350 --> 02:53:54.030
Just my heart is full.

4622
02:53:54.030 --> 02:53:57.460
I'm so grateful to be able to be here with all of you today.

4623
02:53:57.460 --> 02:53:59.400
Thank you to everybody at Ten Thousand

4624
02:53:59.400 --> 02:54:02.420
for not only supporting myself and Robbie,

4625
02:54:02.420 --> 02:54:07.315
but putting together this amazing event for us to indulge

4626
02:54:07.315 --> 02:54:09.410
in community on this level.

4627
02:54:09.410 --> 02:54:13.000
So I'm just happy to be here and appreciate all you guys.

4628
02:54:13.000 --> 02:54:13.954
So thank you.

4629
02:54:13.954 --> 02:54:15.724
(upbeat music)

4630
02:54:15.724 --> 02:54:18.724
(audience clapping)

4631
02:54:23.518 --> 02:54:26.101
(upbeat music)

